---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import { getSite } from '../lib/site';
const s = await getSite();
---
<MainLayout title="Accessibility" description="Accessibility statement for the Charlotte Bjuren website.">
  <Section narrow>
    <div class="prose">
      <span class="kicker">Accessibility</span>
      <h1>Accessibility statement</h1>
      <p>I want this website to be usable by as many people as possible. It aims to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA.</p>
      <p>You should be able to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>use every page with a keyboard alone</li>
        <li>zoom to 200% without losing content</li>
        <li>use a screen reader, with headings, labels and descriptions in place</li>
        <li>read text with good colour contrast</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Known issues</h2>
      <p>The booking service is run by a third party, Cal.com, and its accessibility is outside my control. If it gives you any difficulty, use the enquiry form or email me and I'll arrange a time with you directly.</p>
      <h2>Tell me about a problem</h2>
      <p>If something doesn't work for you, please tell me through the <a href="/contact/">contact form</a> and I'll fix it or get you the information another way.</p>
    </div>
  </Section>
</MainLayout>
